# WISIPAY TRANSACTION LOG (SAMPLE / DUMMY DATA — FOR ASSESSMENT USE ONLY)
# Format per line:
#   TIMESTAMP | TXN_ID=... | INITIATOR=... | BENEFICIARY=... | AMOUNT=... | STATUS=...
#
# Notes:
#  - A transaction may appear more than once if its status was updated later.
#    The most recent line for a given TXN_ID reflects its current status.
#  - Some STATUS values are raw provider codes, not plain text. Use the legend below.
#  - Not every field is guaranteed to be populated.
#
# STATUS CODE LEGEND:
#   SUCCESS   = Transaction completed successfully
#   FAILED    = Transaction failed at the provider
#   PENDING   = Transaction in progress, awaiting confirmation
#   REVERSED  = Transaction was reversed after initially succeeding
#   TIMEOUT   = No response received within the allowed window
#   RETRY     = Transaction re-submitted after a prior TIMEOUT or transient failure
#   HOLD      = Transaction placed under manual compliance/fraud review
#   P102      = Pending - awaiting bank confirmation
#   P201      = Pending - bank system under maintenance; auto-retry scheduled
#   P203      = Pending - compliance check in progress (AML/KYC)
#   F207      = Failed - insufficient balance at source
#   F311      = Failed - beneficiary account invalid or closed
#   F400      = Failed - malformed request or bad input data
#   F401      = Failed - authentication or authorisation error
#   F402      = Failed - daily/monthly transaction limit exceeded
#   F403      = Failed - transaction blocked by fraud-detection engine
#   F500      = Failed - provider internal server error
#   F502      = Failed - provider gateway timeout (upstream)
#   F503      = Failed - provider service temporarily unavailable

